WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.990
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.170
...crazy about you!

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.590
Thank you.

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:49.030
Shall we go?

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:02.890
"'Last Hurricane!"'

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:09.860
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:10.360
Well, our final little shakeup had no effect.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:12.430
I guess this means Toji's really the one.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:17.100
Too bad. I was really looking forward
to a surprise ending on this one.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.440
Ah! I know!

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.440
Okayasu, have you got a cell phone?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.440
Yeah, I do. Why?

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:25.780
I want to call Momo-chan and
tell her we saw what just happened!

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:26.780
No way.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:29.450
Listen, you! After all
that's happened to you,

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:32.450
are you just gonna let them go off
on their trip, cooing like love birds?!

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:35.450
At least give them
one hateful parting shot!

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:39.790
Knowing Momo-chan, I'm sure
she'd come back not so happy with Toji...

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.790
I don't want to do that.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:44.800
Why not?! She dumps you to
go off to her own happiness,

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.060
so what's wrong with being a little mean?!

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:55.530
Okayasu! Where are you going?!

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.480
Don't tell me! A bloody confrontation?!

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.540
Okayasu!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:09.420
I'm sorry I was late. Now we
won't have time to see very much.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.480
We still have half a day!

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:17.090
He sits by me and laughs,
without even asking why l was late...

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.770
l'm so glad l didn't have to
make Toji unhappy. But still...

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:26.770
I think that what they both want
is for you to be happy, Adachi-san.

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:31.780
That's what Misao-chan said,
but is it really all right?

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:36.110
For me to hurt Okayasu, and still
be the one to find happiness?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.010
Will God forgive me for that?

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.790
I thought you were going to
go after Momo-chan's train!

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.120
I'm going to Shiranami.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.790
What for?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.850
For a funeral, I guess.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.800
Are you gonna kill yourself?

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:58.140
No way! No, I'm going to take all my love
and my connection to Momo-chan...

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:03.410
all the feelings that are pent up
in my heart, and take them to the sea.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:06.540
After all, there's no reason to drag
that stuff around with me any more.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:12.420
Sae-chan, how did you get over Ryo?

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:17.290
Me? Well, I'm not like you guys;
I don't repress my feelings,

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:19.090
or try to "'bear up"' under things.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.760
I just get as depressed as I want to get,

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:24.100
and when it's over, I feel refreshed.
Then I don't care any more.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:29.100
That's an idea... So, if I get as depressed
as I want to, will I feel better?

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:32.770
I should think you would. After all,
I think you did the best you could.

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.760
You really loved Momo-chan, didn't you?

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:02.430
This is great! Too bad the weather
couldn't have been a little better.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.400
You tired?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:11.080
You're acting all glum, ever since
the train. Aren't you having fun?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.740
I feel like I shouldn't be enjoying myself.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:16.440
Why? Did something happen?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.780
Well...

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.090
Damn you! Toji! You dumbass!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.960
I can see through this
"'little trip"' you planned!

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.430
I know what you're really after, you prick!

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.430
If you don't take good care
of Momo-chan, I'll kill you!

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.130
You dirty-minded little bastard!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.900
Dear Okayasu, Here's a new
cell phone case. Please use it. Momo.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:54.180
Why? Why wasn't I good enough?

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:04.790
Eh? Okayasu was in Shiranami that day?

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:10.070
I'm so disappointed in myself.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:14.740
Without knowing anything,
look at how badly I've hurt Okayasu...

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:18.740
Can it be all right for me to be
enjoying myself despite all that?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:22.750
Are you thinking that if you hurt Okayasu,
then the heavens will come down on you?

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:28.090
Maybe... I can't stand the thought
of me being the only one who's happy.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.350
Adachi, do you think
Okayasu would be happy

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.090
that you're getting so down on yourself?

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:37.090
When you started dating Okayasu,
frankly, it was a real shock to me.

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:39.400
But Adachi, I think I would
have been even unhappier

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.430
if you had just been alone and sad...

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.300
I think Okayasu is the same way.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:47.170
Adachi, I think that you
are afraid to hurt people

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:50.440
the way the Kashiwagi hurt you before.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:54.450
That shows how sensitive you are
to your own and to other people's pain.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:58.120
But what about now?
Do you hate Kashiwagi now?

00:06:58.120 --> 00:06:59.780
If she were having a good time,
would it really bother you?

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.390
Oh, no!

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:05.890
I mean, even now when she gets me
all stirred up, it bothers me,

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.390
but I don't hate her or anything.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:11.850
See? A wound eventually heals,
and then is stronger than ever.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.510
Feel better now?

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.080
Boy, it's really raining hard.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:36.220
They said a typhoon was coming.
What do you wanna do?

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.090
It's getting late. Should we go back?

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.430
Adachi, do you want to go back?

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:43.550
I want to spend a
little more time with you.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.430
Mm-hmm.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.890
The wind is terrible! I wonder
if the trains are still running...

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:55.770
Sae-chan, you go on back. I'm gonna
stay here a little while longer.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:59.440
With a typhoon coming?!
You might not be able to get back!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:03.040
That's okay. It's a holiday.
Well, take care!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.720
Wait, Okayasu!

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.390
Lend me your cell phone!

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:12.720
My battery's dead, and my folks'll
have a fit if I don't call them.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.730
Okay... here.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.390
Thank you!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.400
Huh?!

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.400
Where's my cell phone case?!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:24.070
Huh? The one Momo-chan made by hand
for you? You threw it away, didn't you?

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.400
I didn't throw it away!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:28.070
But so what? You were going
to throw it away anyway.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.410
No, I wasn't!

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:30.670
I'm gonna go look for it!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:35.180
And he throws himself
back into his heartbreak...

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.310
"'Ueda Hotel"'

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.750
Um... I'll make us some tea!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.120
Uh... yeah.

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:01.260
It's not here... It's gone!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.270
Where did it go?!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.720
I'm sorry.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.720
Why?

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:17.390
I don't know.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:20.060
Adachi, don't you love me?

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:23.650
I do! I do love you! But...

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:27.400
Toji?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.830
I'm gonna cool my head down.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.500
"'You have unread mail
Okayasu
Toji
Toji"'

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.250
Why would Okayasu be
sending me this now?

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.750
"'Title: Bye-bye I can't live
without you, Momo-chan..."'

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.180
"'I'm going to become
fish food at Shiranami."'

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.250
Okayasu...

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.760
Adachi?

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:03.100
Toji! Look at this! Okayasu's gonna...
Okayasu's gonna...

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:06.770
What should I do? I can't
reach him on his phone!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:12.440
Is this really from Okayasu? I didn't think
he'd stoop to this kind of insinuation...

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:16.280
But he's almost died
in the ocean once before!

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:18.120
What if he really means it?!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.580
It doesn't say he's
going to kill himself.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.460
Adachi?!

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.130
I'm going to Shiranami!

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:32.030
Don't act crazy! It doesn't
even say he's in Shiranami!

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.800
He might still be at home.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.770
If we wait to find out,
there'll be no more trains!

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:39.140
If I don't go now,
I may never see him again!

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.400
I don't want to live
with that kind of regret!

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:48.450
Is Okayasu that important to you?

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:58.720
I won't let you go!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.600
Toji...

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.780
You go to Shiranami, and then what?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.110
You search for Okayasu,

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:22.450
and if he looks like he's gonna kill himself,
you'll talk him out of it, and then what?

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:25.120
Adachi, if you show up,
he'll expect something!

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.790
And what'll you do then?
You gonna get back together with him?

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:32.790
If you're just worried about him, and don't
really care that much, then don't go!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:38.130
All this waffling back and forth! Don't you
realize who this is going to hurt the most?!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.030
If you mean to go no matter what,
then break it off with me first!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.140
I'm sorry.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.810
But you have to understand, I've been
acting like I'm okay with everything,

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.480
but the truth is that I've been
filled with a huge anxiety!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.070
Adachi, I worry that you're
going to go back to him!

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:05.760
Look at me! Don't think about him,
but look at me, right in front of you!

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:09.190
I promise I'll be good to you, Adachi...

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:33.010
Go...

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.020
Go anywhere you goddamn please!!

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:41.460
Okayasu!

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.920
Good grief! Where on earth did
that idiot go to look for that thing?!

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:47.020
"'Momo-chan''

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:50.130
Hello? Hello?!

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:53.470
Is that you, Momo-chan?! Hey!

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:57.810
Sae? Oh, no... Oh, what am I gonna do?

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.410
When I read the mail from Okayasu,
I felt like my heart was being crushed...

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:05.420
When I thought Okayasu might die,
I was beside myself...

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:08.420
All I could think of was
to get myself to Shiranami...

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:12.760
Uh-huh... So, Momo-chan,
you want to go to Okayasu?

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:18.760
I can't go to him! That would hurt Toji
so badly! I just don't know what to do...

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:20.560
What to do or what not to do!

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.430
Momo-chan, the only thing you
can do is what you want to do!

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:26.440
So, the question is: which of the
two of them do you love? Okayasu or Toji?

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.110
I can't...

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:32.440
Well, you don't have to suffer
with this indecision, you know.

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:36.110
You undoubtedly had
the answer a long time ago.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:38.450
I mean, your body doesn't lie.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.450
If you don't quit acting like
such a goody-two-shoes,

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.450
you'll be stuck forever! So, bye!

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:44.750
Sae?

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.400
Sae is right. Just sitting
around here trying to decide

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:53.860
isn't going to accomplish anything.

00:13:57.470 --> 00:13:59.800
l have to go! l can't just let this drop.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.070
Adachi...

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:08.870
Adachi!

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:13.420
I'm going to Shiranami!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:18.090
That dummy! If I don't go,
he might really kill himself!

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:22.430
I'm sorry... It's hard
to tell you this now...

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:26.430
I've had lots of chances
to go back to Okayasu,

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:29.430
but it was only when I thought
I might lose him that I realized...

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:32.440
The truth is... I love Okayasu!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:37.110
I'm sorry... I should have
realized this a long time ago.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:41.380
Knowing you, Adachi, I thought that
you were being caught between us

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.780
like a rock and a hard place...

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.710
So I made my own decision.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:50.280
Go on. The trains will stop soon.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.790
But what about you, Toji?

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:56.460
At this point, you don't
need to think of me.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:58.800
But I want you to realize that
you're giving up a great guy,

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:03.400
and there's no way you'll
find more happiness than this.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:07.740
Mm-hmm... Thank you... I'm sorry...

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:10.000
Never mind. Go on.

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:17.370
Thank you, Toji!

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.750
Hey! Will you knock it off already?!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:25.420
It's too dark for you to see anything!
Come back when it's light, and look for it!

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:28.030
No! I can't wait that long!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.760
What'll I do if it blows out
into the ocean during the night?!

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:34.430
How dumb can you be?! You came here
intending to throw it away!

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:37.430
Even if you find it, it's not
going to bring Momo-chan back.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:41.770
I know that!
But I have to have it...

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:46.380
Why? Why is it that I never notice
how important something is to me

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.780
until I lose it?

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.610
I'm really stupid...

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.790
Well, that's quite a calamity...

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.660
But the soil around that area is loose,
and whenever a typhoon comes,

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.720
the trains stop.

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:06.400
And what is a young girl doing at this hour
all by herself, going to Shiranami?

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.420
There's someone waiting for me there.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:16.070
Okayasu... l was just
running away from you...

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:21.080
l was afraid of losing someone again,
so l never really faced you...

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:24.080
To be sure, that way you don't get hurt,

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.750
but you don't understand
each other, either...

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:31.420
l'm not going to run away any more!
This time l'll face you!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.410
So Okayasu, please be safe!

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:53.110
W- wait!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:58.010
This is my cell phone case!
Thank God! Where did you find it?

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:02.720
Get your hands off.
You got proof it's yours?

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:09.280
Proof? Oh, yeah! Sae-chan knows!
She's the girl who came here with me...

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:12.790
Where is she? There's nobody here.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.560
If you got no proof,
I ain't giving it back!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:23.740
That was made by someone very important
to me, and so it's important to me.

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:27.410
I've been looking for it
since yesterday. Please!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:30.080
Well, well. So this is that important...

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.080
Then give me a reward.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.750
A reward for finding it!

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.090
Just a second...

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.760
Huh? That's strange...

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:41.090
I think I lost my wallet...

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:42.430
What a dweeb!

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:47.020
Borrow the money from that chick you
were with, and then I'll give it back.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.100
What the?!

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:56.110
Ow! Hey! Knock it off!

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:57.130
You little bastard!

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:03.380
That hurt, you know!

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.720
Get off it, twerp!

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.340
Hey! Stop it!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:11.390
Please... give it back...

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:12.720
Give it back to him already!

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:15.060
It's obviously important to him.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:17.150
I'll give it back! There!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:20.400
Go get it yourself.

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:21.730
What a jerk.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.070
Yeah, let's go.

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:25.090
Hey! Wait!

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.810
Where... Where is it?

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.750
Shit!

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.410
I'll find it! I will!

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.090
Thank you.

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:46.520
You take care now.

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:00.970
I found it!!

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.110
Okayasu?!

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:11.640
Okayasu!!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:22.060
This is bad... l really
can't move my legs...

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:25.790
How can l die without
seeing Momo-chan again?

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.620
Okayasu! Can you hear me?! Okayasu!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:58.420
He's not breathing!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:05.770
Okayasu! No! Here l've finally
come to you! Okayasu!

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:07.170
Please don't die!

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:15.910
Okayasu! Open your eyes!
I can't live without you!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.780
Okayasu!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.050
Okayasu!!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.730
Momo-chan?

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:40.670
I wonder if this is Heaven...
That's great!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.470
If I can be with Momo-chan in Heaven,
I don't mind dying...

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.630
You idiot!

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:53.150
After I went and saved your life,
don't you dare talk about dying!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.490
Do you have any idea
how worried I was about you?!

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:58.480
Momo-chan? Is it really...

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:07.790
Momo-chan, I... Momo-chan, I...

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:11.200
I love you!

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:17.930
I love you, Okayasu!

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:38.460
Momo-chan, how did you know I was here?

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:41.800
Don't be silly. You sent me a text message.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:44.470
You said you were going to die
and become fish food, remember?

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.470
No, I never sent that.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:49.470
Come to think of it, Sae-chan's still
got my phone, which I lent to her!

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:52.810
How about a photo to commemorate
the beginning of you two as a couple?

00:21:52.810 --> 00:21:56.810
And by the way, the one who sent that
text message was little... old... me!

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:58.820
Sae...

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:00.480
Come back here, Sae!

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:02.420
So what?! It all worked out!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:04.750
That's not the point!

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:16.430
We met at the ocean,
and the ocean has bound us together.

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:19.990
So many emotions
dissolved into this ocean...

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:29.000
l've made up my mind,
and on this ocean, l swear it...

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:43.260
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:52.940
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.940 --> 00:22:55.940
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.940 --> 00:23:02.550
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:08.890
Where can we go

00:23:08.890 --> 00:23:18.560
where we can all be

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:21.230
under the same sky?

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:29.570
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:36.250
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:42.590
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.590 --> 00:23:49.930
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.930 --> 00:23:57.630
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.270 --> 00:24:05.140
"'The End"'
